WEBVTT

00:04:28.294 --> 00:04:30.273
One day, they get a new neighbor,

00:04:32.746 --> 00:04:34.513
bacterial family Capulet.

00:04:34.537 --> 00:04:35.687
(Laughter)

00:04:36.157 --> 00:04:38.947
Everything is fine,
as long as they're working together.

00:04:40.377 --> 00:04:43.383
But then something unplanned happens.

00:04:44.449 --> 00:04:48.667
Romeo from Montague has a relationship
with Juliet from Capulet.

00:04:48.691 --> 00:04:49.841
(Laughter)

00:04:50.978 --> 00:04:53.873
And yes, they share genetic material.

00:04:53.897 --> 00:04:56.006
(Laughter)

00:04:58.630 --> 00:05:01.381
Now, this gene transfer
can be dangerous to the Montagues